{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":26,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["猶大的凱歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["到那日，猶大境內的人必唱這首歌：",{"text":"「我們有一座堅城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華使祂的拯救成為保護我們的城牆和屏障。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打開城門，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓忠信的公義之民進來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使堅信不移的人全然平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們信靠你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要永遠信靠耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華上帝是永遠屹立的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂貶抑高傲的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拆毀他們高聳的城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把它們夷為平地、化為塵土，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被困苦人的腳踐踏，被貧窮人的足踩踏。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"義人的道路是平坦的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公正的主啊，你必修平義人所走的道路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，我們在你行審判的路上等候你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們心裡渴慕你的尊名和威望。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在夜間，我的心思慕你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的靈切切地尋求你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在世上施行審判的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人就學習行義。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然你恩待惡人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻仍然不學習行義。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使在公正之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們依然作惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全不把耶和華的威嚴放在眼裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你的手高高舉起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻看不見。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願他們因看見你向你子民所發的熱心而感到羞愧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你為敵人預備的火燒滅他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你必賜我們平安，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我們所做的事都是你為我們成就的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們的上帝耶和華啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除你以外曾有別的主人管轄我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我們只尊崇你的名。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都已死去，再不能復生，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逝去的靈魂不能再回來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此你懲罰他們，毀滅他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們被人徹底遺忘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，你增添我們的國民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"增添我們的國民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擴張我們的疆界，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你得到了榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，我們在危難中尋求你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你管教我們的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們就向你低聲禱告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華啊，我們曾在你面前呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如臨產的婦人在陣痛中呼喊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們曾懷胎，經歷產痛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但產下來的卻是風。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們沒有給世界帶來拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有給世上帶來生命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，屬你的逝者必復活，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的屍體必站起來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"睡在塵土中的人啊，要醒來歡唱！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的甘露如清晨的甘露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使地下的死人重獲生機。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回到你們的房子裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"關上門躲藏一會兒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等耶和華的憤怒平息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和華要走出祂的居所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懲罰世上犯罪的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地必不再隱藏被殺之人的屍首，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必將流在地上的血顯露出來。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/26.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/27.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/25.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}